Ойымды тынықтыра алдым.

145
00:14:59.058 --> 00:15:02.017
But that clock also stopped this morning.

146
00:15:04.021 --> 00:15:05.084
The fruit did not bear fruit.

147
00:15:07.097 --> 00:15:09.076
I was scared

148
00:15:09.093 --> 00:15:13.068
The moment I saw the consequences of my mistakes was terrifying.

149
00:15:14.047 --> 00:15:18.023
In this case, I would have been much better off staying as a contractor.

150
00:15:20.023 --> 00:15:22.010
Егер сіз мойындағыңыз келсе, бұл басқа адамға.

151
